%% Semantic contract: P and H are independent; each group partition has one consumer owner.
%% One loop acquires a slot before pulling; each handler batch returns its own slot.
%% Cancellation and shutdown paths are omitted. The SVG is the layout source.
flowchart LR
    queue["P 个队列 Partition；P 可以为 1"] -->|拉取一批| dispatch["一个拉取 Consumer + BatchDispatchLoop"]
    dispatch -->|启动一批| handlers["最多 H 个 Handler 批次并发执行"]
    handlers -.->|完成后归还名额| slots["共享执行名额；H = MaxConcurrency"]
    slots -.->|取得名额后才能拉取| dispatch
